## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Working Directory Context**: The codebase files (`app/`, `tests/`, `requirements.txt`, `run.py`) live under the `finance_app/` subdirectory in the repository. The workflow script will explicitly set `defaults.run.working-directory: finance_app` so that build and test steps execute cleanly.

